```

#### GET (Lihat Kalibrasi)

**Request:**
```json
{"AWLR_TD": {"cmd": "GET"}}
```

**Response:**
```json
{"AWLR_TD":{"status":"OK","id":1,"sumur":25.50,"muka_air":12.00,"sensor_awal":0.55}}
```

