### 3.17 GCM / GCM_PUMP — Enable GCM dan Kontrol Pompa Modbus (Multi-Modul)

`GCM` adalah master switch sekaligus *binding* hingga **5 modul GCM** ke slave Modbus RTU. `GCM_PUMP` dan `GCM_MAP` hanya dapat diakses setelah `GCM.enable=1`.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> GCM mendukung **5 modul** (`id1`–`id5`), masing-masing dipetakan ke satu Modbus slave ID (bukan lagi hardcode "Slave 2"). Command `GCM_PUMP`/`GCM_MAP` wajib menyertakan field `id` (1–5) untuk memilih modul; slave RTU yang dipakai = `GCM.id{N}` yang dikonfigurasi.

#### SET — Enable + Binding Slave

**Request:**
```json
{"GCM":{"cmd":"SET","enable":1,"id1":4,"id2":5}}
```

| Field | Tipe | Deskripsi |
|-------|------|-----------|
| `cmd` | string | `"SET"` |
| `enable` | number | `1` aktif, `0` nonaktif |
| `id1`–`id5` | number | *(Opsional)* Slave Modbus RTU untuk modul 1–5 (`0`–`247`, `0` = tidak dipakai). ID non-nol tidak boleh duplikat |

**Response:**
```json
{"GCM":{"status":"OK","enable":1,"id1":4,"id2":5,"id3":0,"id4":0,"id5":0}}
```

#### GET — Baca Konfigurasi GCM

**Request:**
```json
{"GCM":{"cmd":"GET"}}
```

**Response:** *(tanpa `status`)*
```json
{"GCM":{"enable":1,"id1":4,"id2":5,"id3":0,"id4":0,"id5":0}}
```

#### RST — Reset Konfigurasi GCM

**Request:**
```json
{"GCM":{"cmd":"RST"}}
```

**Response:**
```json
{"GCM":{"status":"OK","enable":0,"id1":0,"id2":0,"id3":0,"id4":0,"id5":0}}
```

**Response error:**
```json
{"GCM":{"status":"ERR","msg":"missing cmd"}}
{"GCM":{"status":"ERR","msg":"missing enable"}}
{"GCM":{"status":"ERR","msg":"enable must be 0 or 1"}}
{"GCM":{"status":"ERR","msg":"id must be 0..247"}}
{"GCM":{"status":"ERR","msg":"duplicate slave id"}}
{"GCM":{"status":"ERR","msg":"unknown cmd"}}
```

Saat `GCM.enable=0`, command `GCM_PUMP` dan `GCM_MAP` mengembalikan `{"...":{"status":"ERR","msg":"disabled"}}`.

