#### GCM_PUMP — Kontrol Pompa

`GCM_PUMP` mengirim instruksi pompa via Modbus RTU ke slave yang terikat pada modul `id`. **Tidak ada batasan mode** (dapat dipakai di mode mana pun selama `GCM.enable=1` dan `id` punya slave terkonfigurasi).

#### GET (Baca Status Pompa)

**Request:**
```json
{"GCM_PUMP": {"cmd": "GET", "id": 1}}
```

| Field | Tipe | Deskripsi |
|-------|------|-----------|
| `cmd` | string | `"GET"` |
| `id` | number | Modul GCM (1–5) |

**Response:** *(baca register status / Address 2 via Modbus RTU)*
```json
{"GCM_PUMP":{"status":"OK","id":1,"slave":4,"state":1,"msg":"Pump ON"}}
```

#### SET (Nyalakan / Matikan)

**Request:**
```json
{
  "GCM_PUMP": {
    "cmd": "SET",
    "id": 1,
    "state": 1
  }
}
```

| Field | Tipe | Deskripsi |
|-------|------|-----------|
| `cmd` | string | Harus `"SET"` |
| `id` | number | Modul GCM (1–5) |
| `state` | number | `1` untuk ON, `0` untuk OFF |

> [!NOTE]
> SET bersifat **asynchronous/queued** — handler hanya mengantrekan aksi dan langsung membalas `"QUEUED"`. Status ON/OFF aktual dipublish kemudian oleh `GCM_Task` setelah register status berubah / timeout. Untuk verifikasi gunakan `GCM_PUMP GET`.

**Response (SET):**
```json
{"GCM_PUMP":{"status":"OK","id":1,"slave":4,"msg":"QUEUED"}}
```

**Response error:**
```json
{"GCM_PUMP":{"status":"ERR","msg":"disabled"}}
{"GCM_PUMP":{"status":"ERR","msg":"missing cmd"}}
{"GCM_PUMP":{"status":"ERR","msg":"invalid id"}}
{"GCM_PUMP":{"status":"ERR","msg":"id not configured"}}
{"GCM_PUMP":{"status":"ERR","msg":"missing param state"}}
{"GCM_PUMP":{"status":"ERR","msg":"state must be 0 or 1"}}
{"GCM_PUMP":{"status":"ERR","id":1,"slave":4,"msg":"busy"}}
{"GCM_PUMP":{"status":"ERR","id":1,"slave":4,"msg":"Modbus read fail"}}
{"GCM_PUMP":{"status":"ERR","msg":"unknown cmd. Gunakan GET atau SET"}}
```

