#### Flash Storage

| Key | Nilai |
|-----|-------|
| Flash Address | `0x031000` |
| W5500 Socket | Socket 4 |
| Supported FC | FC03 (Holding Read), FC04 (Input Read), FC06 (Write Single — addr 0–2 saja), FC16/0x10 (Write Multiple — addr 0–2 saja) |
| Max Registers | 23 register (0–22) |
| Exception FC | 0x01 (Illegal Function), 0x02 (Illegal Address), 0x03 (Illegal Value) |

