#### Flash Storage

| Key | Nilai |
|-----|-------|
| Flash Address | `0x008000` (`POWER_CAL_FLASH_ADDR`) |
| Ukuran struct | `PowerCalConfig` — 4×float v_scale + 4×float v_offset + 4×float i_mult + 1×uint8_t valid |
| Catatan | Dipakai untuk semua sensor INA219 (BL11/BL110/BL1100). Kalibrasi sensor Analog (`CAL`) memakai alamat terpisah `0x009000` |

